# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for CI's TSan job (#85).
#
# The scarletbook-rs library linked into the engine is Rust, built without TSan
# instrumentation: TSan sees its memcpy calls (intercepted in libc) but not the
# atomics and fences that order them, so its lock-free internals look like
# races. These entries cover only Rust code inside scarletbook's archive (its
# own crates and its dependencies, by their mangled crate names); pysacd's C
# code stays fully checked. scarletbook's concurrency is tested in its own CI.
race:crossbeam_epoch
race:crossbeam_deque
race:crossbeam_utils
race:rayon_core
race:11scarletbook
race:15scarletbook_ffi
